	(text_box "Xtal capacitors\n\nStray = 2-5pF\nXTAL load cap = \n ECS-.327-12.5-34B-TR = 12.5pF\n ECS-120-10-36B2-CWY-TR =10pF\n\nExt cap = 2(LoadCap -Stray)\n ECS-.327-12.5-34B-TR = 16-20pF\n ECS-120-10-36B2-CWY-TR =10-16pF\n\nSize\n ECS-120-10-36B2-CWY-TR\n = 2.5mm x 2mm\n ECS-.327-12.5-34B-TR\n = 3.2mm x 1.5mm\n"
